      ],
      "source": "https://www.spradleysonspaving.com/montandon-pa-a-historic-village-along-the-susquehanna-river",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Originally called Turtle Creek, Montandon grew around the Northumberland Canal that operated in the mid‑1800s.",
