      ],
      "source": "https://www.spradleysonspaving.com/montandon-pa-a-historic-village-along-the-susquehanna-river",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Montandon United Methodist Church, built in 1834, still serves as a historic place of worship.",
